<title>CYPRUS: Repo yield on Cyprus auction drops to 4.52 pct.</title>
<headline>Repo yield on Cyprus auction drops to 4.52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a repo auction held on Friday between the Central Bank of Cyprus and commercial banks was 4.52 percent, down from 4.57 percent at the last auction on June 2, the bank said.</p>
<p>Yields on the 63 million pounds ($122.5 million) worth of bills sold ranged from 4.43 percent to 4.63 percent. Bids totalled 72 million pounds. ($=0.514 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
